receiveAndDeposit
├── configuration
│   ├── rejects zero required addresses and invalid faucet syntax
│   └── exposes six immutable values; token code size is not assumed
├── invalid envelope, binding, recipient or principal
│   └── rejects before receiver/reserve boundary with specific error
├── valid message
│   ├── wrong remote-token mapping → reject before receive
│   ├── failed receive, nonpositive/wrong/oversized delta → atomic revert
│   ├── approval/reserve/callback failure → atomic revert and original retry
│   ├── underconsumption or residual allowance → atomic revert
│   ├── reentry rejected and uncaught → revert outer
│   ├── reentry rejection caught → one valid outer completion
│   └── success → exact net deposit, donation preserved, allowance zero, one event
└── supplied native value → nonpayable rejection
